1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,744
Everyone shows you the upside.

2
00:00:01,744 --> 00:00:03,016
Let’s do the other side.

3
00:00:03,516 --> 00:00:05,333
Goldmap EA lets you set a

4
00:00:05,333 --> 00:00:06,837
daily profit target.

5
00:00:06,837 --> 00:00:08,090
Say 1.5 percent,

6
00:00:08,090 --> 00:00:10,471
