7
00:00:10,971 --> 00:00:12,728
The upside panel assumes you win

8
00:00:12,728 --> 00:00:13,754
every single day.

9
00:00:13,754 --> 00:00:15,707
The website itself says that doesn’t

10
00:00:15,707 --> 00:00:17,025
