11
00:00:17,025 --> 00:00:18,245
so we’re skipping it.

12
00:00:18,745 --> 00:00:19,963
Now the other side.

13
00:00:19,963 --> 00:00:22,134
One bad basket costing thirty percent

14
00:00:22,134 --> 00:00:24,676
