17
00:00:28,241 --> 00:00:29,699
nine percent. Not thirty.

18
00:00:30,199 --> 00:00:31,970
At a 1.5 percent target,

19
00:00:31,970 --> 00:00:34,436
that’s roughly 24 winning days just

20
00:00:34,436 --> 00:00:35,575
to climb back.

21
00:00:36,075 --> 00:00:37,431
That’s why the lot cap and

22
00:00:37,431 --> 00:00:39,194
