23
00:00:39,194 --> 00:00:40,640
more than the target itself.

24
00:00:42,075 --> 00:00:44,019
Try the calculator yourself,

25
00:00:44,019 --> 00:00:45,842
then tap Get Goldmap EA at

26
00:00:45,842 --> 00:00:48,334
goldmapea.com. Only run money you can

27
00:00:48,334 --> 00:00:50,096
genuinely afford to lose.
